\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {10}{\ignorespaces Delivery-predictor calibration study (500 clients, 150 round-instances per cell). The left panel shows reliability at the 0.1\,s deadline. With oracle link state the hazard-form predictor is calibrated by construction, while the power-distorted ($\gamma $) and noisy variants are measurably miscalibrated. The right panel shows the assignment-objective loss of optimizing against the distorted predictor, evaluated under true probabilities, at most 1\% \DIFdelbeginFL  {\color {red}\sout {and only }}\DIFdelendFL  in \DIFdelbeginFL  {\color {red}\sout {the tightest }}\DIFdelendFL  \DIFaddbeginFL  {\color {blue}\uwave {every }}\DIFaddendFL  cell.}}{26}{}\protected@file@percent }
